<< /AP << /N 902 0 R >> /C [ 1 1 1 ] /Contents (Only about a third of the cohort knew the correct formula for the Trap Rule.  Even then, many did not find the width of the intervals correctly.) /CreationDate (D:20211203102113+11'00') /DA (0.898 0.1333 0.2157 rg /Helv 12 Tf) /DS (font: Helvetica,sans-serif 12.0pt; text-align:left; color:#E52237 ) /F 4 /M (D:20211203102421+11'00') /NM (bfe165d4-1b44-4c24-bb96-7dba45395622) /P 505 0 R /RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:21.5.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"  style="font-size:12.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-stretch:normal"><p dir="ltr"><span style="font-family:Helvetica">Only about a third of the cohort knew the correct formula for the Trap Rule.  Even then, many did not find the width of the intervals correctly.</span></p></body>) /Rect [ 199.14 336.274 385.266 409.884 ] /Subj (Text Box) /Subtype /FreeText /T (KilmoreB) /Type /Annot >>
